"The man himself called us and claimed to have shoot his partner," a police spokeswoman said.
The perpetrator is on the run, after him is publicly searched.
Meanwhile nationwide, because Sven S. could be traveling by car.
The man is about 1.80 meters tall, muscular, tanned and has a bald head.
